OL,3,GNEWSAWorking in green and yellow office
OL,4,Adifficult, says ITFC sponsor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA technology boss said he has had to
OL,7,Fmake peace with the fact his firm's new
OL,8,Fheadquarters is coated in the colours
OL,9,Fof his beloved Ipswich Town's arch
OL,10,Frivals.
OL,12,FPaul Hamilton is the founder of Halo,
OL,13,Fwhich has just moved into the town's
OL,14,Ficonic Willis Building - a Grade I
OL,15,Flisted glass office space designed by
OL,16,FLord Foster.
OL,18,FThe interior office spaces are yellow
OL,19,Fand green ` the club colours of Norwich
OL,20,FCity ` which Hamilton, a "massive" fan
OL,21,Fof the Blues/Tractor Boys, has quickly
OL,22,Fhad to get used to.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
