OL,3,GNEWSAWorking in green and yellow office
OL,4,Adifficult, says ITFC sponsor
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I first saw it I was like
OL,7,F'there's no way we can make this work',
OL,8,Fand it was difficult at first, but we
OL,9,Fare not going to change it," he said.
